4em 0.6em}.mw-parser-output .infobox.geography .maptable td,.mw-parser-output .infobox.geography .maptable th{border:0;padding:0}</style><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"border-spacing:3px; width:30em;\"><caption class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan\" title=\"Damallsvenskan\">Damallsvenskan</a></caption><tbody><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Datum</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/17_april\" title=\"17 april\">17 april</a>–<a href=\"/wiki/6_november\" title=\"6 november\">6 november</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Sport%C3%A5ret_2021\" title=\"Sportåret 2021\">2021</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Nya lag för säsongen</span></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll_Damer\" title=\"AIK Fotboll Damer\">AIK</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_Fotboll_(damer)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hammarby IF Fotboll (damer)\">Hammarby IF</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Vinnare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a> (12:e <a href=\"/wiki/Svenska_m%C3%A4stare_i_fotboll_(damer)\" title=\"Svenska mästare i fotboll (damer)\">SM</a>-titeln)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Nedflyttade</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4xj%C3%B6_DFF\" title=\"Växjö DFF\">Växjö DFF</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uefa_Women%27s_Champions_League_2022/2023\" title=\"Uefa Women&#39;s Champions League 2022/2023\">Champions League</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken_FF\" title=\"BK Häcken FF\">BK Häcken</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Kristianstads_DFF\" title=\"Kristianstads DFF\">Kristianstads DFF</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f2;\">Statistik</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Spelade&#160;matcher</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">132</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Totalt&#160;antal&#160;mål</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">355 (2,7 per match)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Bästa målgörare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stina_Blackstenius\" title=\"Stina Blackstenius\">Stina Blackstenius</a> (17 mål)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/BK_H%C3%A4cken_FF\" title=\"BK Häcken FF\">Häcken</a> 10–0 <a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll_Damer\" title=\"AIK Fotboll Damer\">AIK</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(20 juni 2021)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/AIK_Fotboll_Damer\" title=\"AIK Fotboll Damer\">AIK</a> 0–7 <a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">Rosengård</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(29 maj 2021)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Målrikaste match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border:none;text-align:center;\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;background-color:transparent;color:inherit;text-align:center;\">2 matcher</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\" style=\"font-weight:normal;background-color:transparent;colo